{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000025424","bookName":"Mi hija nos llevó a la cima","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000025424/42000025424.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":272604,"followCount":8790,"introduction":"La pequeña Ana Gómez no lograba canalizar completamente su energía vital, lo que causaba imperfecciones en sus hechizos. Al darse cuenta de que Marcos Gómez era su destino, Ana se convirtió en su hija y comenzó a ayudarlo a resolver los problemas que enfrentaba. Gracias a sus esfuerzos, logró curarle los ojos y las piernas. Más tarde, finalmente encontró a su madre, Sara, y los tres comenzaron a vivir juntos una vida feliz en familia.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Family Bonds","Lost Child"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Lost Child"],"typeTwoIds":[336],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":336,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Mi-hija-nos-llevó-a-la-cima","bookNameLower":"mi-hija-nos-llevó-a-la-cima","shelfTime":"2026-08-24 13:38:04","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-24 13:38:04","performerList":[{"performerId":"19676","performerName":"Dandan Peng","performerFormatName":"Dandan-Peng","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/6x7/19676/19676.jpg?time=1787541713176","videoCount":5},{"performerId":"23409","performerName":"Lei Yao","performerFormatName":"Lei-Yao","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x0/23409/23409.jpg?time=1787541713159","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[19676,23409]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701513961","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/16/4x2/42x4/424x5/42452000024/701513961_1/701513961.720p.wz.h264.mp4?Expires=1795194000&Signature=np78Js78oMQYCW~ZVx4J-xXXAVU-SK3OyQmmIfpBip~mazuHwqRnvWlObXs60hmaOSqEcMjN6Uqg8yMNUlg0jwns0ILq~~MVvKpN3QrCRXEsKHfNdk~Xr52VRHcVDj5zvXKEW1nq0mpVz~vkiB5BYi5hFD1VX2goveyvTMhJEy49MWl6VEXHjNmBaW